		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Pool of Tears is a wide, still lake in the east of the swamp. Broken columns and the stumps of old stairways rise from its shallows. Beneath its waters lies the {link:temple-of-atal-hakkar}Temple of Atal'Hakkar{/link}, which the green dragonflight broke and drowned so that the priests of {link:hakkar}Hakkar{/link} could never finish their summoning. Fragments of the Atal'ai are still found in the mud of its shores: idols, fetishes and carved stones. The dragons of Ysera's flight guard the lake. Wyrmkin and scalebanes stand on its banks, and they suffer no one to come near without cause. The Atal'ai still dwell in the drowned halls below.]=],
