		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Fallow Sanctuary is the village of the lost ones, in the north of the swamp. Its huts of reed and hide crowd around cooking fires, and its hunters, fishermen and seers go out from it into the marsh. The lost ones look like the draenei of the {link:the-harborage}Harborage{/link}, for they were once one people. But the long journey that brought them to {link:azeroth}Azeroth{/link} broke their minds, and now they seize or kill anyone who strays near. Stolen goods pile up among their huts: sacred draenethyst crystals taken from the Harborage, and the wagons of an {link:alliance}Alliance{/link} caravan. Their chieftain rules the village. A lost one called {link:ongeku}Ongeku{/link} keeps a shard of draenethyst there as his own.]=],
		},
	},
